<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Nestle AG.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Nestle AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG says it has issued five million American-style call warrants, on Nestle AG.</p>
<p>50 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,700.00 CHF	    PREMIUM	13.80 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.15 CHF		  GEARING	14.50 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 28.FEB.97-19.FEB.99   PAYDATE	25.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,590.0 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
